1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,400
(Sheldon:)Amy Farrah Fowler,

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,340
(Sheldon:)and Penny.

3
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,040
(Amy:)Yes!

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:10,410
(Amy:)He had you in the other car,
but I got you upgraded.

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,080
(Penny:)Yay!

6
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,950
(Sheldon:)She made the case
that if we break down

7
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:17,790
(Sheldon:)in the middle of nowhere,
your Nebraska backwoods skills

8
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,850
(Sheldon:)and brawny hands
will give us the best chance

9
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,860
(Sheldon:)to survive in the wild.

10
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,230
(Penny:)Brawny?

11
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,760
(Leonard:)They're bigger
than mine.

12
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:30,770
(Sheldon:)Red Leader to Red Five,
come in.

13
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:35,800
(Sheldon:)Red Leader to Red Five,
come in.

14
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,010
(Sheldon:)Howard, you promised.

15
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,910
(Bernadette:)WOLOWITZ
Fine. Red Five to Red Leader.

16
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:43,480
(Howard(voice):)What do you want now?

17
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:49,080
It's 11:15. I'm requesting your
quarter-hourly location update.

18
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,750
(Howard:)Still right behind you.

19
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:53,790
(Sheldon:)Copy that, Red Five.

20
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:55,390
(Sheldon:)Radio contact is sufficient.

21
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:58,020
(Sheldon:)No need to extend
your middle finger.

